; Strings
_apps$                            EQU                          0x7ff0
_apps$                            DW                           0x7ff7 0x7ff5 
_apps$_0x7ff7                     EQU                          0x7ff7
_apps$_0x7ff7                     DB                           7 'Invader' 0
_apps$_0x7ff5                     EQU                          0x7ff5
_apps$_0x7ff5                     DB                           0 '' 0

